## Paste an id from a create user response (POST /users or /auth/signup)
@userId = paste-user-id-here

## Paste an id from a create post response (POST /posts)
@postId = paste-post-id-here

## Get posts (default limit=10, page=1) - expect 200
GET http://localhost:3000/posts

###
## Get posts with pagination - expect 200
GET http://localhost:3000/posts?limit=5&page=1

###
## Filter by author - expect 200 ([] if the author has no posts)
GET http://localhost:3000/posts?authorId={{userId}}

###
## Filter by author with pagination - expect 200
GET http://localhost:3000/posts?authorId={{userId}}&limit=5&page=2

###
## authorId not a UUID (@IsUUID) - expect 400
GET http://localhost:3000/posts?authorId=abc

###
## limit above 100 (@Max(100)) - expect 400
GET http://localhost:3000/posts?limit=500

###
## Get post by id - expect 200 (or 404 if it doesn't exist)
GET http://localhost:3000/posts/{{postId}}

###
## Unknown post id - expect 404
GET http://localhost:3000/posts/00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000

###
## id not a UUID (ParseUUIDPipe) - expect 400
GET http://localhost:3000/posts/abc
